---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import famPic from '../../img/fam_pic.jpg';
---

<Base title="About" description="How Griddle Me This, Dad? got started.">
  <PageHead title="How it started" eyebrow="About" />
  <div class="container about" style="padding-top: 32px">
    <Image src={famPic} alt="The family" width={720} widths={[360, 720]} sizes="(min-width: 760px) 360px, 100vw" />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        The inception of <b>Griddle Me This, Dad?</b> began during the COVID-19 pandemic when I found myself with more
        time on my hands than usual. While perusing online, I found a Blackstone griddle that was a really great value,
        that my wife gave me for my birthday. I have always been passionate about cooking and I wanted to take my
        culinary repertoire beyond the kitchen, to the outdoors.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cooking has always been at the heart of our family. Gathering for good times, great conversations, and even
        better food is a common theme at our family gatherings. Taking to my griddle, every meal seemed to be a great
        hit with my fabulous wife and three wonderful sons. Couple my growing fascination to the griddle with a kitchen
        renovation, the griddle became the go-to cooking appliance for this summer.
      </p>
      <p>
        I hope you enjoy this site. I would like to thank my beautiful and caring wife for her inspiration, and my three
        wonderful sons for their dedication and support to this ongoing effort. I love you all.
      </p>
      <h2>Keep in touch</h2>
      <p>
        Keeping in touch doesn’t have to be a hassle. Subscribe via email to have recipes sent straight to your inbox
        for free and never miss an update! Comments and suggestions on recipes are welcome, or you can email us
        directly. Beware the Subsquatch!
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="/contact/"><Icon name="mail" /> Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
